WEBVTT

00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:00.421
I needed to start
by being less of a jerk to myself,

00:05:00.463 --> 00:05:02.631
which I thought
was the kind of thing you hear

00:05:02.673 --> 00:05:05.259
from Instagram influencers
and spin instructors, so --

00:05:05.301 --> 00:05:06.552
(Laughter)

00:05:07.636 --> 00:05:09.722
And she even went so far as to suggest

00:05:09.764 --> 00:05:13.017
that when I saw my demons
emerging in meditation,

00:05:13.059 --> 00:05:15.686
I should put my hand on my heart
and say to myself,

00:05:15.686 --> 00:05:17.480
"It's OK, sweetie. I'm here for you."

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:19.231
(Laughter)

00:05:19.231 --> 00:05:20.524
Hard pass.

00:05:20.524 --> 00:05:21.734
(Laughter)

00:05:21.734 --> 00:05:24.487
Pasadena. I was not going to do that.

00:05:24.487 --> 00:05:28.449
But over the ensuing days
of nonstop meditation,

00:05:28.449 --> 00:05:31.827
I did notice that my twin demons
were in full effect.